<title>PHILIPPINES: Mexico to issue yen bonds soon - Ortiz.</title>
<headline>Mexico to issue yen bonds soon - Ortiz.</headline>
<dateline>CEBU, Philippines 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico will issue yen bonds soon, Mexican Finance Minister Guillermo Ortiz said on Sunday.</p>
<p>He told Reuters Financial Television that legal restrictions prevented him from being more specific on the timing and amount of the issue.</p>
<p>However, a government source later said to expect the issue to be in the market early this week.</p>
<p>Ortiz was in Cebu for a meeting of APEC finance ministers.</p>
